Create a comprehensive, searchable audit trail.

Every important action must generate an audit event.

Include:
- Simulation started.
- Test case generated.
- Agent processing started.
- Agent processing completed.
- Message sent.
- Message received.
- TrustMesh verification started.
- Verification passed.
- Data loss detected.
- Data modification detected.
- Validation failed.
- Message blocked.
- Retry initiated.
- Recovery succeeded.
- Human review requested.
- Final decision generated.

Each event should include:
- Unique event ID.
- Timestamp.
- Claim ID.
- Test case ID.
- Source agent.
- Destination agent, when applicable.
- Event type.
- Severity.
- Status.
- Affected field.
- Original value, if applicable.
- Received value, if applicable.
- Reason.
- Action taken.
- Related event ID.

Provide:
